            "title": "擎海II首推128伙均呎14,611元｜較擎海I高4.45%｜兩房入場呎價低同區二手近11%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">越秀地產發展的油塘新盤擎海II，今日（19日）公布首張價單，首批推出128伙，涵蓋一至兩房戶。扣除最高18%折扣後，折實均呎14,611元，一房折實入場費由395.01萬元起。首批開價較今年9月推出的同系擎海I高4.45%，惟較2020年至2023年間開售的親海駅、朗譽及蔚藍東岸低約2.57%至18.55%，與近期同區新盤定價較為接近。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">項目步行至港鐵油塘站約需11分鐘，較區內多個新盤稍遠，周邊亦有不少工業大廈。發展商將於本周六（21日）起收票，最快下周開售。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-60e2e8cb-258d-3f01-9011-68137123583f-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">閱讀更多：</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"擎海II價單\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:擎海II價單;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4jrhVOU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">擎海II價單</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>首批128伙均呎14,611元 折實395萬入場</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">擎海II首推128伙，分布於第1及2座，涵蓋81伙一房戶及47伙兩房戶，實用面積285至503平方呎。扣除最高18%折扣後，折實售價395.01萬至766.01萬元，折實呎價13,499至16,182元，折實均呎14,611元，整批單位總市值約8.33億元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">一房入場戶為2座5樓E室，實用面積289平方呎，折實售價395.01萬元，呎價13,668元；兩房入場戶為2座5樓C室，實用面積429平方呎，折實售價595.01萬元，呎價13,870元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">最低呎價單位為2座3樓G室一房戶，實用面積323平方呎，折實售價436.01萬元，呎價13,499元。最高呎價單位則為2座28樓A室兩房戶，實用面積461平方呎，折實售價746.01萬元，呎價16,182元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>首批開價高擎海I 4.45% 低親海駅及朗譽逾2%至18%</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">擎海II首批折實均呎14,611元，較今年9月推出的同系擎海I高4.45%，後者首批折實均呎為13,988元。與去年11月推出的柏景峰相比，當時首批150伙折實均呎14,588元，擎海II亦微高約0.16%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇擎海I最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇擎海I最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/3WR0UoL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇擎海I最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇柏景峰最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇柏景峰最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4jqRUzl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇柏景峰最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">長實於2023年8月推出的親海駅I及親海駅II，首批折實均呎分別為15,250元及14,997元，擎海II較兩者低約4.19%及2.57%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇親海駅I最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇親海駅I最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4t8laxW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇親海駅I最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇親海駅II最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇親海駅II最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4jps8LM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇親海駅II最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">2022年11月及2020年11月開售的朗譽與蔚藍東岸，首批折實均呎分別達17,938元及17,688元，擎海II則低約18.55%及17.40%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇朗譽最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇朗譽最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4CheguI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇朗譽最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇蔚藍東岸最新價單】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇蔚藍東岸最新價單】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4AFSfny\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇蔚藍東岸最新價單】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">交通及生活配套亦影響買家選擇。擎海II步行至油塘港鐵站約需11分鐘，較擎海I、親海駅I、親海駅II、朗譽及蔚藍東岸的8至10分鐘稍遠。區內主要購物及餐飲設施集中於油塘港鐵站一帶，包括大本型及鯉魚門廣場，擎海II住客前往大型商場需多走一段路。柏景峰則較接近港鐵站及現有商場，親海駅及蔚藍東岸位處臨海地段，部分單位可享海景。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">擎海II周邊仍有不少工業大廈，住宅發展及配套改善需時。項目首批呎價較擎海I及柏景峰略高，但低於數年前開售的多個新盤。綜合交通、周邊環境及購物配套，今次開價未算特別進取，能否吸引買家仍要看市場反應。</p><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bc331813b9e7a4193d5259f6cd85ff2227f3e853c48c263ee078a004ef58acf6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2Fd2e41c82e320904c8d86df121b0ce347.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>一圖睇清擎海II定價比較</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>兩房入場呎價較蔚藍東岸二手低約11%</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">鄰近的蔚藍東岸近期錄得一宗兩房戶成交，實用面積450平方呎，以700萬元易手，呎價約15,556元。擎海II實用面積429平方呎的兩房入場戶，折實呎價約13,870元，較上述二手成交低約10.84%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">28Hse旗下土地查冊平台「易發土地註冊資訊平台（Eva Land Search）」資料顯示，該宗成交為蔚藍東岸5座中層G室，原業主於2020年12月以853.1萬元一手購入，今年10月以700萬元轉售，持貨近6年，賬面虧損153.1萬元，物業貶值約17.94%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">樓齡約3年的蔚藍東岸，目前有<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"45個放盤\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:45個放盤;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4j3HiFk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">45個放盤</a>，叫價390萬至3,200萬元，每呎叫價14,391至24,078元不等。擎海II兩房入場呎價低於上述二手成交價，或有助吸引同時考慮新盤及二手樓的買家。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"【即睇蔚藍東岸最新放盤】\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:【即睇蔚藍東岸最新放盤】;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://b.28hse.com/4j3HiFk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">【即睇蔚藍東岸最新放盤】</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>周六起收票 最快下周開售</strong></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">發展商表示，項目將於本周六（21日）起收票，最快下周開售。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">擎海II位於油塘東源街23號，設有第1及2座，合共提供617伙，實用面積242至721平方呎，涵蓋一至三房戶。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">項目屬小學48校網，中學校網則為觀塘區，預計關鍵日期為2028年12月30日，樓花期約25個月。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">延伸閱讀: <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"朗譽\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:朗譽;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/朗譽?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">朗譽</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"柏景峰\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:柏景峰;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/柏景峰?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">柏景峰</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"蔚藍東岸\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:蔚藍東岸;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/new-properties/蔚藍東岸?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">蔚藍東岸</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"親海駅\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:親海駅;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/親海駅-28316?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">親海駅</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"擎海\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:擎海;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/擎海-34115?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">擎海</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"觀塘\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:觀塘;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.28hse.com/estate/detail/觀塘-27367?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=news_sync&amp;utm_content=news_78661\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">觀塘</a><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\"